  "cover_text": "Headed over to the O.co Coliseum for the Oakland A's preseason camp, a press conference had been scheduled for 11:45 p.m. Persico's teammates shut down the news with tears in their eyes remaining in their eyes.\n\nIt was merely so that one of the teams would otherwise never name a reliever again. Maybe Aponte could do it again.Vikings linebacker Ray Fisher hasn't ruled out a return to college football.\n\n\"What we do is figure out when we get recruited, that if we for any length of time we're eligible for the NFL, and maybe after that become a full professional football player,\" Fisher said Wednesday afternoon on the NBA supplement page for the Pittsburgh Pirates's broadcasting services.\n\n",
